   "name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" id=\"wixDesktopViewport\" ",
   "name=\"description\" content=\"Our homestay offers a variety of activities for an enriching stay. Explore Wagamon's beauty with jeep safaris, trekking, and cycling. Unwind with plantation walks, live barbecues, and serene poolside moments. Engage in cultural experiences, enjoy music nights, and savor delicious meals prepared by our chef. Your stay promises an immersive escape, catering to varied interests.\"",
   "property=\"og:title\" content=\"SEE &amp; DO | The Mountain Table\"",
   "property=\"og:description\" content=\"Our homestay offers a variety of activities for an enriching stay. Explore Wagamon's beauty with jeep safaris, trekking, and cycling. Unwind with plantation walks, live barbecues, and serene poolside moments. Engage in cultural experiences, enjoy music nights, and savor delicious meals prepared by our chef. Your stay promises an immersive escape, catering to varied interests.\"",
   "property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c18256_c623270b113b42aaa3981dedc1077ade%7Emv2.jpg/v1/fit/w_2500,h_1330,al_c/c18256_c623270b113b42aaa3981dedc1077ade%7Emv2.jpg\"",
   "property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2500\"",
